{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_kirara_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kirara_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "隐藏结局",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kirara_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9c646752745fee670104b29d98580cca48d7a6eaa7f515c7f43a0ecd002b6aff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤冬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和云母同学约好在这碰面的，她人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么，你和那个来治病的同学也约在这里了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，向导？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（抬头看了一眼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（举起手机，对准公路上的风景）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（继续在手机上敲击）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "向导女士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（敲击手机屏幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么把手机举起来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“向......导......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后面还跟着个问号？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是和我约好带我出城的那个向导？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（敲击手机屏幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“不......是......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你为什么要上我的车？难道你是龙门近卫局派来的 ？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（敲击手机屏幕）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别打字了，给我说话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门......近卫局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把话说清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以为你是......接我去罗德岛的司机先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问你们刚才在这见过一个拖着大箱子的少女吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拖箱子的少女？没见过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你迟到了一个小时，刚刚才跑过来，你当然没见过！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姑娘，你说的是一个拖着大行李箱的女孩子，看起来和你差不多大，对不对？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错没错！你看到她的时候，她是不是正在专心致志地拿着掌机打游戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这话怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她确实拿着个看起来像游戏机的东西玩了一会儿，但很快就收回去了，之后就把手机掏了出来，一会儿打字一会儿照相的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（她自己的手机是从东国带来的，在龙门能用吗？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（没时间管那么多了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该就是她没错。您知道她去哪儿了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚一辆车停在她前面，她和司机对了个眼神，就拖着行李箱上车了。那个司机还帮她把行李搬进后备箱里了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那辆车往哪开了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会这样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有这么巧的事，约好给我带路的向导也是东国装束的阿戈尔年轻女性......怎么偏偏就多了你这么个碍事的出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有话快说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想问一下......为什么......你觉得我穿的是东国装束啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你穿得就像从东国的漫画里走出来的一样，不是东国装束是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为只有穿得像个武将或者巫女一样才算典型的东国装束......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "武将？巫女？那不都是漫画里的东西吗，东国真有这种人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你开这么快......要去哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去哪？我要回家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我和朋友约好了，她在刚刚我上车的那个地方等我......您能不能先把我送回去再回家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想都别想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者......您的家在哪里？您先回自己家，我再想法子让朋友来接我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我家在叙拉古，这下你满意了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叙、叙、叙拉古？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝对不行！我一路从东国赶过来，可没时间再去一趟叙拉古了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看见这把刀了吗，小姑娘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道你是......黑帮？叙拉古的黑帮？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不全是......但也差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我老实坐好，你现在是我的人质了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......你说了你没接到向导，就算出了龙门也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "闭嘴！我没有第二次机会了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个蠢贼不光抢了珠宝店，居然还劫持了人质......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真抱歉，赤冬小姐。合作调查的请求是我们向罗德岛方面提出的，结果出了这种事，让您的朋友也牵连进来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些话以后再说！现在你们的处理措施是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们已经派人在高速公路和移动城市的各个出入口设卡盘查了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么不说话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（举起手中的掌机）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都到了这个份儿上了，你还有心情打游戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可理喻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，游戏不好玩了，又把手机拿起来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是我从东国带来的手机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "东国的手机在龙门是不能用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......给我看看你在写什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别废话，把手机交给我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝对不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿过来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*叙拉古粗口*，堵车？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，小姑娘，这下我可腾出手来了，把手机给我看看。如果你没在给人通风报信，我不会拿你怎么样的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向你保证，我没在做对你不利的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保证有什么用？如果保证有用，我会被人骗到这种地方来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先把手机给我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我把手机合上好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "旁边车里的人已经在看我们了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*叙拉古粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不打字了，我把手机收起来，我接着打游戏，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从刚才开始就是，你隔几分钟就“啊”这么一下，到底怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一关......我死了四五次了。我......静不下心来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嫌我碍事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（顺手掏出手机）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你干什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对、对不起！我只是顺手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我回了叙拉古再放你走，到时候你想发短信发短信，想打游戏打游戏，没人乐意管你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的要回叙拉古？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还能去哪儿？该死的亲戚把我骗来了龙门，说这里商机无穷......我呸！什么商机！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他其实是被人拖下了水，加入了黑帮家族，就想给自己也找个跑腿的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我捏着鼻子跟他干了几个月，实在受不了他们的这些龌龊事，刚一提要回家，他就抢了一家珠宝店，把罪名栽赃到我头上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才不想在异国他乡被关个几十年！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的父亲母亲都在叙拉古，我出发前他们苦苦劝我，可我当时昏了头，根本不听他们的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在只想回家，只想见见他们！只要能见他们一面，我被人当成懦夫沉进河里也值了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（习惯性地掏出手机，开始打字）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）其实......我也不想离开家啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）从我家那座移动城市到这里，路上我也吃了不少苦头......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你现在根本没有向导......你真的能回叙拉古吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你说怎么办？去找近卫局？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算是被骗的，我现在也是个黑帮分子。黑帮去和近卫局的人讲道理，说“我是被人陷害的”？他们可能听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他们不想听你说，你说再多话都没有用，他们只会按照自己的想象曲解你说的话。我知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为你会拼了命劝我去找近卫局的人“解释情况”呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，就算你不能说服他们，应该也不会死......如果是在荒野上出了什么事，就真的再也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母＆陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，那边是——龙门近卫局的封锁线？！他们在一辆辆排查？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你居然又把手机拿出来了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚刚果然在给近卫局发消息！把手机给我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "云母，赶紧下车，我们是罗德岛的干员，我们来接你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死的，近卫局的走狗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "云母，抓住我的手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，为什么不动？现在情况紧急，有什么事情之后再说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，云母同学，你放在后备箱里的收藏我已经拿到了，你赶快跟赤冬下车，那个劫匪交给近卫局对付！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是宴？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（叹息声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然被他给跑了，不过还好，云母同学没事，云母同学保护了一路的行李箱也没事，可喜可贺，可喜可贺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "云母同学，你在听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你现在惊魂未定，不过一直在这里站着，可是会堵塞交通的哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果茶也喝了，享誉龙门的鳞丸也吃了，这下总该镇定下来了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......嗯。谢谢你，宴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我给你介绍一下，这位看起来像个武将一样的人是罗德岛的干员赤冬，刚刚那个劫匪的车，本来应该是她去坐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就是那个劫匪口中所谓的“向导”啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个人要找的......东国装束的阿戈尔年轻女性......是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正是。龙门近卫局已经盯上了那个劫匪，又害怕打草惊蛇，才让我假扮向导，伺机将其捉住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁知我疏忽大意了，还连累云母你受惊，实在抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没......没关......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（习惯性地掏手机）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（慌张地掏手机）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用短信跟对面的人交流可不礼貌哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是......我的手机落在那辆车上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，一会儿我们一起去挑一个新的，就当是给你压惊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是那个手机里面有很重要的东西，真的很重要的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道里面记着什么游戏的秘籍？还是说里面有对战高手的联系方式？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......虽然里面确实都有，但不是那些事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴，我们能不能追上那辆车？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤冬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追凶的事已经转交给龙门近卫局办了，我们再跟过去，只怕会给他们添乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤冬，云母看起来可是真的着急了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以我对她的了解，就算刚刚她的收藏都跟着那辆车跑得无影无踪，她都不会这么焦虑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说是吧，云母同学？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（重重点头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然如此，我们跟近卫局打声招呼也不是不行。但那个劫匪已经冲卡跑掉了，我们该去哪找他呢？"
