    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好，那个人好像已经失去理智了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再这么僵持下去，近卫局会下达强攻指令。一旦交起火来，云母的手机恐怕保不住，那个人自己也凶多吉少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤冬，我们能不能偷偷溜进去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "绝对不行。闯进近卫局的警戒线里，近卫局就不能保证我们的人身安全了，现在只能寄希望于那个人赶紧冷静下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我问过近卫局，他抢劫珠宝店并未造成伤亡，对他的处理应该是监禁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，监禁总比死掉强，他什么时候才能明白过来呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可他......说他自己是冤枉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他在车上的时候跟我说的，他其实没去抢那家珠宝店，他是被人陷害的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他真说过这种话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赤冬，麻烦你去把这件事告诉近卫局的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒是没问题，但近卫局的人可不会因为一个人的证言就放过他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也比现在这样僵持着要好！快去吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿近卫局的人知道之后能改变一下策略。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "云母同学，我们还是先离开这里吧，如你所见，现在我们只能寄希望在别人身上了。"
