    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“谢谢”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事部干员",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不客气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "云母同学，不是已经跟你说过了吗，面对面还要打字交流，这也太不礼貌了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱......歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，算了，你这性格也不是一天两天养成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我带你去住的地方看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天真是千钧一发，我以为那个人死定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情告一段落之后，你受了那么大的惊吓，还去为他作证，也真是难为你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，对他的判决下达了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有这么快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，我听赤冬说，近卫局查到最后，抢劫珠宝店的真凶的确不是他，他现在的罪名是妨碍公务和......和什么来着，我记不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "考虑到他加入黑帮也是受人蛊惑，可能关个一年半载就被驱逐出境了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可都是你的功劳啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也只不过是让他注意到了手机而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他看了里面的东西，知道我在车上的时候没有骗他，也就仅此而已了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的吗？所以你手机里到底写了什么咒语，能让那种穷凶极恶的家伙放弃抵抗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有什么咒语，只是些再普通不过的东西罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然是了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么普通，还不给我看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是真的没有看的必要，我说真的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我就不逼问你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜拜，云母同学，如果累了就睡一觉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的不是什么咒语，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "云母",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些要誊下来寄出去的东西而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "云母掏出手机，在草稿箱里一路上滑，一直滑到自己出发那天的日期。\n离开家乡那座移动城市之后，手机的邮件功能就不能用了。\n但初次离家的少女仍然把路上的见闻和感想事无巨细地记录在了邮件的草稿箱里。\n云母从抽屉里拿出一叠信纸，照着草稿箱里面的文字，一字一句地誊抄起来。\n草稿箱里既有大段的文字，也有凌乱的只言片语。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "云母忘我地抄写着，写满了一张又一张信纸，直到日期上最晚的那一篇草稿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "草稿到此戛然而止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "云母撕下写着这份草稿的信纸，把纸揉成一团，扔到地上。\n她把手机屏幕关掉，在新的信纸上重新写下了“第三十四天”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
